-50,prologue,prologue-g8-scenario-card,scenario.context,,,g8-scenario-card,Earlier that day — mission preparation,
-51,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.text,,,app,GEMINI VIII,
-52,g8-prep,g8-brief,label,,,g8-prep,Preparation,
-53,g8-prep,g8-brief,label,,,g8-prep,PRE-FLIGHT,
-54,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.badge,,,app,CONTACT: NOT IN FLIGHT,
-55,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Preparation opportunities: 2 of 2 remaining,
-56,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.button,,,app,BINDER,
-57,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.button,,,app,HISTORY,
-58,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.button,,,app,SAVE / LOAD,
-59,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Conversation,
-60,g8-prep,g8-brief,label,,,g8-brief,Mission briefing,
-61,g8-prep,g8-brief,briefing,,,g8-brief,"Armstrong and Scott will rendezvous and dock with Agena. Before launch, you have time for two extra ground rehearsals: short practice runs on the communications loops, with controllers passing a report or instruction and checking that the right desk received it. The crew's training and mission rules are already in place; these exercises prepare the people in your room to work together under pressure.",
-62,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Evidence,
-63,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.heading,,,app,Evidence · 2,
-64,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.title,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,Network coverage and report timing,
-65,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.tooltip,,,app,Pin to keep this report in view. Pinning changes nothing in the mission.,
-66,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Pin: Network coverage and report timing,
-67,g8-prep,g8-brief,label,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,REFERENCE,
-68,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.title,,,g8-ev-rule,Mission termination after RCS activation,
-69,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Pin: Mission termination after RCS activation,
-70,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Console,
-71,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.button,,,g8-brief-continue,Go to preparation,
-72,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,"The last report tells us what was true when the crew sent it. Between tracking passes, we have no new information about their condition. Keep the report's observation time beside it; mark anything since that time as unconfirmed. The crew must act on their own until the next station acquires their signal.",
-73,g8-prep,g8-brief,history-hidden,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,Automatic at briefing; instructional reference grounded in H1. Sources: H1.,
-74,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-rule,"Both rings of the reentry control system have been activated to regain control, and substantial propellant has been used. Under these conditions, mission rules require termination. Cancel the remaining objectives and prepare a contingency return.",
-75,g8-prep,g8-brief,history-hidden,,,g8-ev-rule,Automatic at briefing; reference. Historical termination principle H2; game selection boundary F7. Sources: H2. Fiction register: F7.,
-76,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Unpin: Mission termination after RCS activation,
-77,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.button,,,app,GOT IT,
-78,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,briefing,,,g8-prep-select,"In the contact drill, Houston CAPCOM and a tracking-ship CAPCOM practice sending an instruction, reading it back, and confirming receipt to FLIGHT. In the recovery drill, Elias and the Department of Defense recovery coordinator practice passing the aircraft's location report to the ship and confirming who sends the pickup instruction. In the systems drill, Mara calls a low-propellant warning to FLIGHT and CAPCOM together, then passes her recommended response before the next entry task begins.",
-79,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.label,,,app,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,
-80,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.prompt,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-prep-select,Choose up to two supplemental ground rehearsals.,
-81,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.hint,,,app,Opportunities remaining: 2 of 2. Reading reports and asking questions use no rehearsal opportunities.,
-82,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.aria,,,app,Options,
-83,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.label,,,app,Intent,
-84,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.intent,,,g8-prep-contact,Rehearse sending an instruction and confirming its receipt.,
-85,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.label,,,app,Cost,
-86,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.cost,,,g8-prep-contact,Uses one of your two rehearsal opportunities.,
-87,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.heading,,,app,Details,
-88,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.label,,,app,Attraction,
-89,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.attraction,,,g8-prep-contact,CAPCOM and the tracking station practice the readback before a time-critical call.,
-90,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.label,,,app,Uncertainty,
-91,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.uncertainty,,,g8-prep-contact,A missed pass can still leave the instruction waiting for radio contact.,
-92,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.button,,,app,Rehearse,
-93,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.intent,,,g8-prep-recovery,Rehearse passing the pickup instruction from the recovery desk to the ship.,
-94,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.attraction,,,g8-prep-recovery,Elias and the DoD coordinator settle who sends the pickup call before the recovery begins.,
-95,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.uncertainty,,,g8-prep-recovery,The crew may still face a long wait if the nearest ship is far away.,
-96,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.intent,,,g8-prep-systems,Rehearse calling a low RCS propellant warning to FLIGHT and CAPCOM.,
-97,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.attraction,,,g8-prep-systems,Mara practices getting her warning and recommended response to both desks promptly.,
-98,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.uncertainty,,,g8-prep-systems,The warning may arrive before Mara knows what caused it.,
-99,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.button,,,g8-prep-finish,Finish preparation,
-100,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.aria,,,app,Unpin: Network coverage and report timing,
-101,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.title,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-worksheet,Contact drill: instruction and readback,
-102,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.aria,,contact rehearsal,app,Pin: Contact drill: instruction and readback,
-103,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.badge,,any rehearsal,app,CHOSEN,
-104,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.requirement-reason,,any rehearsal,g8-prep-contact,Completed,
-105,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.body,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-worksheet,"Houston CAPCOM sends the instruction to the tracking-ship CAPCOM, who reads it back and confirms receipt. FLIGHT checks the confirmation before treating the instruction as received. Mark missing observation times as unknown.",
-106,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,history-hidden,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-worksheet,"Acquired by g8-prep-contact; original F1 reference. Named practice calls and desk roles are original game exercises, not a claim that these exact rehearsals occurred before Gemini VIII. Fiction register: F1.",
-107,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.title,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-worksheet,Recovery drill: pickup instruction,
-108,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.aria,,recovery rehearsal,app,Pin: Recovery drill: pickup instruction,
-109,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.requirement-reason,,two rehearsals,g8-prep-systems,No preparation opportunities remaining.,
-110,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.body,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-worksheet,Elias passes the aircraft's location report to the DoD recovery coordinator. They identify the desk that will send the ship its pickup instruction and check the readback. Record aircraft support and the ship's arrival separately.,
-111,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,history-hidden,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-worksheet,"Acquired by g8-prep-recovery; original F2 reference. Named practice calls and desk roles are original game exercises, not a claim that these exact rehearsals occurred before Gemini VIII. Fiction register: F2.",
-112,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.title,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-worksheet,Systems drill: low-propellant warning,
-113,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.aria,,systems rehearsal,app,Pin: Systems drill: low-propellant warning,
-114,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.body,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-worksheet,"Mara reports the RCS propellant warning to FLIGHT and CAPCOM together. She states what the instruments show, what remains uncertain, and the response she recommends for entry. CAPCOM reads the recommendation back before passing it on.",
-115,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,history-hidden,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-worksheet,"Acquired by g8-prep-systems; original F3 reference. Named practice calls and desk roles are original game exercises, not a claim that these exact rehearsals occurred before Gemini VIII. Fiction register: F3.",
-116,g8-docking,g8-docking-report,label,,,g8-docking,Docking,
-117,g8-docking,g8-docking-report,label,,,g8-docking,MET approximately 06:33,
-118,g8-docking,g8-docking-report,ui.badge,,,app,CONTACT: TRACKING SHIP,
-119,g8-docking,g8-docking-report,label,,,g8-docking-report,Docking report,
