-423,resolution,resolution,outcome.result_line,,later q1,g8-out-later-1,Both crew members are back after difficult entry preparations. A delayed warning or repeated instruction made the return harder.,
-424,resolution,resolution,relationship.name,,not earlier q2,g8-recovery,Elias Reed,
-425,resolution,resolution,ui.alt,,not earlier q2,app,Portrait: Elias Reed,
-426,resolution,resolution,outcome.title,,earlier q1,g8-out-earlier-1,"Crew recovered — earlier return, difficult pickup",
-427,resolution,resolution,outcome.result_line,,earlier q1,g8-out-earlier-1,Both crew members are back aboard after a difficult pickup. A call that needed clarification or repeating added to their exhaustion.,
-428,resolution,resolution,outcome.title,,later q2,g8-out-later-2,"Crew recovered — extra orbit, prompt warning response",
-429,resolution,resolution,outcome.result_line,,later q2,g8-out-later-2,"The mission ended early, but the warning and entry instruction reached the crew promptly. Both crew members are back after an orderly response with little RCS propellant remaining.",
-430,resolution,resolution,outcome.tier,,q0,g8-out-later-0,COSTLY,
-431,resolution,resolution,outcome.title,,later q0,g8-out-later-0,"Crew recovered — extra orbit, rushed entry",
-432,resolution,resolution,outcome.result_line,,later q0,g8-out-later-0,Both crew members are back after rushed entry preparations with little RCS propellant remaining. Repeated calls squeezed the time they had to get ready.,
-433,resolution,resolution,outcome.title,,earlier q0,g8-out-earlier-0,"Crew recovered — earlier return, punishing sea wait",
-434,resolution,resolution,outcome.result_line,,earlier q0,g8-out-earlier-0,"Both crew members are back aboard, badly exhausted after the sea wait. Delays in the pickup calls made an already hard recovery worse.",
