-441,debrief,debrief,followon.paragraph,,earlier,g9-recovery-drill-required,The crew paid for the earlier return with a long sea wait. Recovery rehearsal is required. Choose the other exercise.,
-442,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,,app,Post-flight findings and disagreement,
-443,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,crew-blame,app,Glen's statement: “I agree with the criticism. Armstrong and Scott's handling of the emergency deserves the blame.”,
-444,debrief,debrief,ui.text,,,app,Neil Armstrong — Command Pilot,
