-450,debrief,debrief,ui.text,,,app,Tom Stafford — Astronaut,
-451,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,crew-blame,app,Astronaut corps divided. Your endorsement of the crew criticism still divides the corps. Armstrong and Scott enter future work with damaged confidence in you; Cunningham and Stafford's support is stronger.,
-452,debrief,debrief,ui.heading,,,app,Procedures binder,
-453,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,lesson: provenance,app,"Report timing and confirmation (adopted procedure): Record who sent each report, when the observation was made, and when it was received. List missing information separately and keep it unconfirmed until a new report arrives.",
-454,debrief,debrief,ui.heading,,,app,"What happened, and why",
-455,debrief,debrief,debrief,,,g8-db-return,Docking was achieved. The remaining objectives were terminated. Both crew members were recovered alive.,
-456,debrief,debrief,debrief,,earlier,g8-db-earlier,You chose to end spacecraft exposure sooner and accepted a prolonged sea recovery.,
-457,debrief,debrief,debrief,,earlier & recovery rehearsal,g8-db-pickup-clean,The recovery drill established who would send the pickup instruction. The desks didn't need to settle that during pickup; the ship still had to cover the same distance.,
-458,debrief,debrief,debrief,,contact rehearsal,g8-db-ack-clean,The contact drill helped CAPCOM confirm receipt on the first call. The room didn't need to ask again during the return.,
-459,debrief,debrief,debrief,,earlier,g8-db-recovery-next,Elias's response is recorded above. The next mission must include a recovery rehearsal; you'll choose its companion exercise.,
-460,debrief,debrief,debrief,,lesson: provenance,g8-db-provenance,You added report timing and confirmation to the procedures binder.,
-461,debrief,debrief,debrief,,crew-blame,g8-db-crew-blame,"You endorsed the criticism of Armstrong and Scott. Cunningham and Stafford's support grew, both crew members lost trust in you, and the astronaut corps became more divided.",
-462,debrief,debrief,ui.heading,,,app,Departures from the record,
-463,debrief,debrief,debrief,,earlier,g8-db-departure-earlier,"Return timing — Historically, Gemini VIII landed in the western Pacific during its seventh revolution and the crew awaited USS Leonard F. Mason. You chose the game's earlier return. The particular ship delay, darkness, crew exhaustion, and rehearsal-dependent pickup sequence are alternate events, not a reconstruction of that recovery.",
-464,debrief,debrief,debrief,,crew-blame,g8-db-departure-blame,"Accountability — Post-flight analysis cleared Armstrong and Scott, while Cunningham and Stafford criticized their handling of the emergency. Kranz instead faulted the ground's lack of docked-flight contingency procedures. You backed the crew's critics. Glen's statement, the increased division, and the changes in astronaut trust are alternate consequences of your choice.",
-465,debrief,debrief,ui.button,,,app,CONTINUE TO GEMINI IX-A,
-466,debrief,debrief,ui.button,,,app,REVIEW THE RESULT,
-467,debrief,debrief,label,,,trust_labels,Confidence strengthened,
-468,debrief,debrief,label,,q2 | ground-accountability,trust_labels,Working confidence,
-469,debrief,debrief,label,,q0 | crew-blame,trust_labels,Confidence damaged,
-470,debrief,debrief,followon.paragraph,,crew-blame,g9-status-corps-divided,Astronaut corps divided,
-471,debrief,debrief,followon.paragraph,,crew-blame,g9-status-corps-divided,Your endorsement of the crew criticism still divides the corps. Armstrong and Scott enter future work with damaged confidence in you; Cunningham and Stafford's support is stronger.,
-472,debrief,debrief,procedure.title,,lesson: provenance,proc-report-provenance,Report timing and confirmation,
-473,debrief,debrief,procedure.text,,lesson: provenance,proc-report-provenance,"Record who sent each report, when the observation was made, and when it was received. List missing information separately and keep it unconfirmed until a new report arrives.",
-474,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,ground-accountability,app,"Glen's statement: “The ground didn't have enough contingency procedures for the docked phase. That's our failure, and we'll correct it. I won't blame Armstrong and Scott for bringing the spacecraft home.”",
-475,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,ground-accountability,app,Notes: Crew confidence in Glen strengthened,
-476,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,ground-accountability,app,Ground contingency work commissioned. The crew's confidence in you has strengthened. The critics haven't withdrawn their objections; work on docked-flight contingency procedures is under way.,
-477,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,ground-accountability,app,"Docked-flight contingency development (commissioned task): Develop and rehearse procedures for emergencies while docked. List the symptoms the crew and ground can observe, agree who passes each warning, and prepare for a loss of contact before a diagnosis is complete.",
-478,debrief,debrief,debrief,,ground-accountability,g8-db-ground-accountability,"You accepted responsibility for the missing ground procedures. The crew's trust in you grew, and you commissioned docked-flight contingency work.",
-479,debrief,debrief,debrief,,ground-accountability,g8-db-departure-ground,"Accountability — Kranz criticized the ground's lack of contingency procedures for docked flight; post-flight analysis cleared Armstrong and Scott. You took the same broad position on responsibility. Glen's words, the commissioned task, and the resulting trust changes are invented, and this choice doesn't return the rest of your campaign to the historical record.",
-480,debrief,debrief,followon.paragraph,,ground-accountability,g9-status-contingency-work,Ground contingency work commissioned,
-481,debrief,debrief,followon.paragraph,,ground-accountability,g9-status-contingency-work,The crew's confidence in you has strengthened. The critics haven't withdrawn their objections; work on docked-flight contingency procedures is under way.,
-482,debrief,debrief,procedure.title,,ground-accountability,proc-docked-contingencies,Docked-flight contingency development,
-483,debrief,debrief,procedure.text,,ground-accountability,proc-docked-contingencies,"Develop and rehearse procedures for emergencies while docked. List the symptoms the crew and ground can observe, agree who passes each warning, and prepare for a loss of contact before a diagnosis is complete.",
-484,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,lesson: recovery cross-check,app,Recovery cross-check (adopted procedure): List air support and surface retrieval separately; distinguish requested from confirmed support.,
-485,debrief,debrief,debrief,,lesson: recovery cross-check,g8-db-recovery-procedure,You carried recovery cross-checking into the procedures binder.,
-486,debrief,debrief,procedure.title,,lesson: recovery cross-check,proc-recovery-crosscheck,Recovery cross-check,
-487,debrief,debrief,procedure.text,,lesson: recovery cross-check,proc-recovery-crosscheck,List air support and surface retrieval separately; distinguish requested from confirmed support.,
-488,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,q1,app,Trust 0 → -1 · Confidence strained,
-489,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,later q1,app,Notes: Entry preparations delayed by a repeated call,
-490,debrief,debrief,followon.paragraph,,later,g9-systems-drill-required,The extra orbit left the crew facing entry with critically low RCS propellant. A systems-warning drill is required. Choose the other exercise.,
-491,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later,g8-db-later,You chose another orbit to land closer to the recovery force. The crew completed entry with critically low RCS propellant.,
-492,debrief,debrief,debrief,,not q2,g8-db-rework,Calls that needed clarification or repeating delayed the pickup or squeezed the crew's entry preparations. The crew-condition report records the result.,
-493,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later,g8-db-systems-next,Mara's response is recorded above. The next mission must include a systems-warning rehearsal; you'll choose its companion exercise.,
-494,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later,g8-db-departure-later,"Return timing — You took the later opportunity, as history did: Gemini VIII landed in the western Pacific on its seventh revolution and the crew awaited USS Leonard F. Mason. The propellant warning, the closer pickup, and the crew-condition sequence on this route are dramatized, not a reconstruction of that recovery.",
-495,debrief,debrief,label,,q1,trust_labels,Confidence strained,
-496,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,earlier q1,app,Notes: Sea exhaustion — moderate,
-497,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,later q2,app,Notes: Entry instruction confirmed promptly,
-498,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later & systems rehearsal,g8-db-warning-clean,The systems drill helped Mara get her warning to FLIGHT and CAPCOM together. She didn't have to repeat the assessment; the crew still had little RCS propellant left.,
-499,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,later q0,app,Notes: Entry preparations rushed after two repeated calls,
-500,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,earlier q0,app,Notes: Sea exhaustion — severe,
